#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/typestate-pattern/typestate-example.md:6
msgid "Typestate Pattern: Example"
msgstr ""

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/typestate-pattern/typestate-example.md:8
msgid ""
"The typestate pattern encodes part of a value’s runtime state into its type. "
"This allows us to prevent invalid or inapplicable operations at compile time."
msgstr ""

